RuleSet: BundleResource(type,id)
* entry[+].fullUrl = "urn:uuid:{id}"
* entry[=].request.method = #PUT
* entry[=].resource = {id}
* entry[=].resource.id = "{id}"
* entry[=].request.url = "{type}/{id}"

